; Cross-implementation tests for Irmin-Eio.
;
; Must be built from the Irmin workspace (cuihtlauac-inline-small-objects-v2),
; not from the irmini monorepo (library name conflict with "irmin").
;
; To build:
;   1. Copy test-irmin-eio/ into the Irmin workspace root
;   2. Uncomment the executable stanza below
;   3. dune exec test-irmin-eio/main.exe
;
; Or use test/run_tests.sh which automates this.

; (executable
;  (name main)
;  (libraries irmin irmin.mem alcotest eio_main unix)
;  (modules test_irmin_eio main))
